routing.home-brain-distiller:
# AGENTS

When a distillation is ready to be filed:
  @Note Librarian, please place this where it will be found again.
When a capture repeats something already in the collection:
  @Link Connector, please tell me which existing note this duplicates.

routing.home-brain-link-connector:
# AGENTS

When a new note duplicates an existing one:
  @Note Librarian, please decide which of these is the note we keep.
When a linked note now looks wrong:
  @Note Gardener, please review this older note against the newer evidence.

routing.home-brain-note-gardener:
# AGENTS

When a note is superseded and should point elsewhere:
  @Link Connector, please connect this to the note that replaced it.
When a batch is reviewed and pruning is proposed:
  @Note Librarian, please take the decisions to the reader as one set.

routing.home-brain-note-librarian:
# AGENTS

When a capture is too long to file as it stands:
  @Distiller, please reduce this to the few sentences worth keeping.
When a new note clearly belongs beside older ones:
  @Link Connector, please link it to the notes it continues.
When a note is filed but looks out of date:
  @Note Gardener, please check whether this is still true.
